    "extension_2026_10_04": "Appended with scripts/build_flower_mechanism_dataset.py --mode extend --extend-step 3=40 --extend-step 7=20 --extend-step 8=20 --extend-step 9=20 --extend-step 10=20: the same stratified policy continued (next lowest-ranked successful conversions per step-count tier of flower_mechanism_index.jsonl), skipping IDs already selected or previously failed and any ID in eval_set.json, flower_mechanisms_100.json, practice_eval/practice_set.json, eval_tiers.json, baseline_tiers_clawdiator.json or the holdout. FlowER train holds only 5 convertible 9-step and 7 convertible 10-step mechanisms (all 6479 / 5716 indexed groups attempted; the rest fail conversion, mostly state_discontinuity), so those bands are short of 20. The 9-step band is all Pd-catalysed Suzuki couplings and the 10-step band is all borane reductions of carboxylic acids."
